The following metrics emitted by kubeletstats receiver were deprecated in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-contrib/pull/25901:
- k8s.node.cpu.utilization
- k8s.pod.cpu.utilization
- container.cpu.utilization

Those metrics are already excluded by default in the signalfx exporter. So if we don't do anything, the user will see the following warnings that are not actionable:
